{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} υἱοὶ φωτός}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "Sons of Light"} · 光明之子 (5:5)}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
本書逐段研讀帖撒羅尼迦前書全書五章，分十一章，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹：神揀選、神的道運行、神召人成聖、神必帶來、神親自成就。每章整合老弟兄查經法、屈梭多模與加爾文的歷代注疏、摩根的解經，以及麥克阿瑟的逐節講道（gty.org）；所有加引號的注疏，均與原著或講道逐字稿核校。這是一封寫給只牧養了幾個安息日的教會的家書——它最深的安慰不在末世的時間表，而在那位「必親自從天降臨」的主。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ passage-by-passage study of all five chapters of First Thessalonians in eleven chapters, built on the order of God's own acts in the letter --- He chooses, His word works, He calls to holiness, He will bring with Jesus, He Himself completes --- integrating Elder Wong's way of reading, the commentary of John Chrysostom, John Calvin and G. Campbell Morgan, and John MacArthur's exposition (gty.org), every quotation checked against its source.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 信 · 愛 · 望}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Faith, Love, Hope}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
